{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deadly Joy</strong> is a multiplayer horror survival game where each player is a Play Center employee chosen to complete dangerous missions under the watchful eyes of the facility's eerie mascots. Between cooperation and betrayal, every choice matters\u2026</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Parkour</strong> \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f: A deadly obstacle course where only the smartest and fastest will reach the end. <strong>Hugster</strong> will be there to &quot;guide&quot; you, but will you help others or eliminate them to be the sole winner?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basement</strong> \ud83c\udfed: Work together to sort objects, but beware\u2014one mistake punishes everyone. Will you trust your teammates, or sabotage the mission for your own survival?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tower</strong> \ud83c\udfe2: Escape a trap-filled tower crawling with <strong>CatBox</strong>, adorable yet deadly creatures. Cooperate\u2026 or eliminate your rivals before they do. And remember, <strong>Hugster</strong> might be lurking in the shadows.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Deadly Joy</i>, every decision matters. Will you be an ally\u2026 or a traitor?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567350?t=1745542149","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567350?t=1745542149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567350/9f42040a4a1f715e3a7a0f9bdf3d9e8be22680b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745542149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567350/9f42040a4a1f715e3a7a0f9bdf3d9e8be22680b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745542149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36